  "type": "container",
  "name": "structural-scanner",
  "body": "The bundled structural scanner (`src/structlib`, binary `structfrontend`; absorbs `src/mdlib`), shipped in the base apg package. It emits a `File` node for every tracked file it claims and structure for the text formats — Markdown (unchanged `md` id), shell, YAML, JSON, TOML, XML, Dockerfile, Makefile and INI — with `misc` as the residual. It absorbs `solution.container.md-frontend`: the Markdown frontend's code and its dependency contract live in the base. Build-time deps: a current stable Rust toolchain plus crates.io. Scan-time deps: zero — it runs entirely in-process. Engine pin: serde/serde_json/unicode-normalization 0.1; the structural formats are bounded by that crate set alone.",
